{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here","id":30545,"title":"Enter your glitches here","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-15T13:16:34-08:00","id":30545,"title":"Enter your glitches here","content":"I'll start with a catastrophic brand:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/6vIkbJC.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-15T17:55:46-08:00","id":30657,"title":"","content":"Damn, I love it.<br /> <br /> The main one I have in mind, one I want to start in play with when I play this, is that regardless of cover, the demon always has the same distinctive eye color-a different, brilliant shade of blue for each eye, one more 'heavenly', one more 'icy'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T08:33:19-08:00","id":30988,"title":"","content":"My Stigmatic's brand turned his irises crimson red.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T09:30:27-08:00","id":31030,"title":"","content":"The two most outstanding Glitches in my play-test group were both Tells.<br /> <br /> One belonged to a Demon named Door, whose character concept was that he was an entire building. Each of his covers was a tenant, and he had Demon House so he could control the building. In accordance with his concept he hated things being in disrepair, so he had a compulsion to fix things. This was most prominent when he stopped halfway through an operation to repair on out of order elevator. <br /> <br /> The second was on a Demon named Silver (or Mr. Silver) an Inquisitor inspired by Rod Serling and the Twilight Zone. His inspiration, inquisitiveness, and doubt lead to a fantastic glitch: Silver couldn't speak in definitive statements. So most of his sentences started with lines like: &quot;Perhaps...&quot; or &quot;Consider if you will...&quot; or &quot;Imagine for a moment...&quot;. It was a crazy hard glitch to pull off, but his player did it so damn well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T10:19:10-08:00","id":31052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PenDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=31030#post31030\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The second was on a Demon named Silver (or Mr. Silver) an Inquisitor inspired by Rod Serling and the Twilight Zone. His inspiration, inquisitiveness, and doubt lead to a fantastic glitch:<b> Silver couldn't speak in definitive statements. </b>So most of his sentences started with lines like: &quot;Perhaps...&quot; or &quot;Consider if you will...&quot; or &quot;Imagine for a moment...&quot;. It was a crazy hard glitch to pull off, but his player did it so damn well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Stay out of my brain, Pen. I mean it this time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/478-intrepid-vector","name":"Intrepid Vector","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar478_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T07:18:29-08:00","id":33157,"title":"","content":"Do demon's sweat? they must, to not sweat would ruin covers<b>.<br /> <br /> Acidic Sweat</b><br /> I had a pair of glasses once that were made from cheap plastic, that from the natural chemicals in my sweat, the plastic began to degrade.<br /> Imagine this as a Brand, it could come in all 3 forms.<br /> <br /> <b>Minor:</b> your sweet shows as acidic. At the extreme upper level of what is possible for a human.<br /> Over long time, items exposed to your skin, suffer the effects. Discolouration and extra wear on clothing.<br /> <br /> <b>Major: </b>Your sweat is as acid, and has similar effects to fairly strong acids. In addition to worsening the effects of the lower levels,<br /> it now displays acidic chemical effects. For example, it reacts with metals, and so if you drip swat while running on metal stairs, you can be tracked by the visible markigns where the surface layer of metal has been dissolved. Mortals touching your sweat won't be harmed, but it will sting slightly.<br /> <br /> <b>Catastrophic:</b><br /> Your sweat is cartoon levels of strong. If you could be squeezed for a cup of sweat it would be weaponisable. As it is there is not enough to seriously damage someone, but it might be usable to inflict a tilt in combat from the burning sensation. During intense physical exertion, your cloths are quickly deteriorated. If barefoot, your prints can be clearly seen etched in to metal, and markings may be seen on other materials such as wood or stone.<br /> <br /> Also I guess you could have a Minor Brand: Can't Sweat","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T21:04:53-08:00","id":41497,"title":"","content":"I've been working on a circuitry brand type glitch that my character has tried covering up with a tattoo. I assume the glitch will get worse and worse as the story progresses which will necessitate the character adding more and more to the tattoo. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/OHK31pd.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://i.imgur.com/OHK31pd.jpg</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T22:28:52-08:00","id":41523,"title":"","content":"After the story I ran last night/yesterday,<br /> here are the glitches I came up with (posting because ST's are going to need a ton of glitches for the campaigns, I had one player who always had temporary glitchs equal to his primum, (a few hours in to the game). Everytime one would expire he would, gain another, renewing it)<br /> I think I needed about 10 of them over 3 chapter, even heavily recycling.<br /> <b>Acid Sweet</b>, as describe above was a hit with the players.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Minor Tell: two handed handshake</b><br /> <br /> <b>Major: High Frequency Whine:</b> If you stand too close to radio equipment, there is a quiet high pitched audio tone added.<br /> <b>Major: Bushy Eyebrows</b>, Eyebrows that are intensly bushy and resemble a steel wool.<br /> <b>Major: Workshop scent.</b> You always smell like a workshop where angle grinding, and arc welding have been recently done","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T20:09:27-08:00","id":73522,"title":"","content":"I'm having trouble sorting out whether this would be major or catastrophic:<br /> <br /> <b>Tell:</b> Speaks in quotations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T22:13:28-08:00","id":73552,"title":"","content":"Major if in their own voice. Catastrophic if said in the voice of the person who originally said the quote.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T22:29:40-08:00","id":73559,"title":"","content":"Depends on how attributable or notable the quotations are required to be.<br /> <br /> Honestly, you could make a case for it being Minor, if you knew enough fans/nerds/whatever. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T22:32:23-08:00","id":73560,"title":"","content":"I'd also put in that, with perfect memories, it would not be terribly too hard to amass a large volume of material to draw from. Your written correspondence would also not be affected with the glitch as written, so really it seems to only make for awkward conversations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T19:09:27-08:00","id":75382,"title":"","content":"Let's get some emanations up in this thread.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm looking at you, Vocal embeds and exploits based on them.<br /> <br /> Remix<br /> Minor Emanation: Your voice has a processed quality, not necessarily auto-tuned but definitely not a live performance<br /> Major Emanation: Your voice is definitely auto-tuned or heavily sampled/filtered.<br /> Catastrophic Emanation: From bad dubs to celebrities caught in a lip-sync fiasco. A complete mis-match<br /> -- Emanations tend to affect an environment but I wonder if this one could be a brand. <br /> <br /> This one's for the guardians.<br /> <br /> is that a 6 or a 9?<br /> Minor Emanation: timepieces around you tell slightly different times. Within the same hour<br /> Major Emanation: timepieces around you tell markedly different times Within the same 6 hour period<br /> Catastrophic Emanation: time pieces around you tell impossible times, even analogue timepieces.(i.e. 5 and 3/8 past -255)<br /> <br /> <br /> For all the Mundane embeds<br /> <br /> The rationale behind this one is that Mundane embeds tend to promote stealth and normalcy. These glitches are a perversion of that premise. The glitch's effects put the demon in increasingly more obvious central roles. That said, these glitches especially can wreak havoc with the tone of your game. <br /> <br /> Take 1 <br /> Minor Emanation: unscripted t.v. Odd, but plausible and completely unscripted events tend to happen around your demon. People who don't get along run into each other more often. Someone DEFINITELY makes a scene at the restaurant/party. Random strangers tend to be more candid with their innermost thoughts around you. You may find yourself in the middle of a flash-mob.. (is that still a thing?)<br /> Major Emanation: You are the focus of all the &quot;completely unscripted events&quot;. Your cover's high-school/childhood sweetheart/enemy happens to re-enter your life. Your cover is the target of a proposal which makes it on Youtube.<br /> Catastrophic Emanation: A context appropriate soundtrack may accompany you. Perhaps your cover is now a Real Housewife of a major city. Disney Princesses have nothing on you - spontaneous dance numbers are not-unheard of. <br /> <br /> <br /> Can't think of anything interesting for Cacaphonic embeds right now, maybe later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1930,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","user":"Rixx","date":". 02-20-2014, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","name":"Rixx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T02:23:08-08:00","id":76154,"title":"","content":"Tossed a fun one on one of the wheels. I called it &quot;pieces and parts&quot;. The demon was fond of the phrase &quot;a journey of a thousand miles begins with one step&quot; as a major glitch she saw everything in terms of their component parts. A truck wasn't a truck, it was a configuration of engine parts, axels, tires, a muffler ect... We had fun manifesting it in both rolls and story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1991-fallenxanderel","name":"FallenXanderel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T12:28:58-08:00","id":85542,"title":"","content":"<b>Tell:</b> Compulsive nicknaming.<br /> <b>Emanation:</b> Converts nearby writing into <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elder_Futhark\" target=\"_blank\">futhark</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T09:05:18-07:00","id":94979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rixx</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=75382#post75382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Catastrophic Emanation: A context appropriate soundtrack may accompany you. Perhaps your cover is now a Real Housewife of a major city. Disney Princesses have nothing on you - spontaneous dance numbers are not-unheard of.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCO0J1N661U\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCO0J1N661U\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCO0J1N661U\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCO0J1N661U </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T10:29:16-07:00","id":95031,"title":"","content":"I have a Demon who styles himself a Christian/Gnostic angel tasked with smashing the works of the demiurge. The first Glitch on his list is shouting &quot;Be not afraid!&quot; whenever he enters a room, even when he's in Cover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T08:36:16-07:00","id":159084,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.iflscience.com/health-and-medicine/what-does-it-look-when-person-gets-struck-lightning\" target=\"_blank\">Lichtenberg brandings</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T08:43:40-07:00","id":159108,"title":"","content":"Those Lichtenberg brandings are fascinating.<br /> <br /> My Saboteur has only developed one minor glitch so far, although it's permanent. The irises of her eyes suffer from image compression errors; they slowly change color, but only in tiny bits at a time, resulting in a subtle image-noise effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T21:13:30-07:00","id":265941,"title":"","content":"I came up with an excellent tell the other day, and I am writing it down so I don't forget it.<br /> <br /> Tell - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leitmotif\" target=\"_blank\">Leitmotif</a><br /> <br /> For some reason, whenever the demon is the focus of a scene or doing something important, a particular song or tune plays. It could be that someone happens to get a phonecall and it's the ringtone, or it's playing on the radio, it comes on a TV ad or a passerby feels compelled to whistle that particular tune.<br /> <br /> Edit: Ahaha, I see someone had posted it in the thread before me :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","user":"Xenesis","date":". 09-26-2014, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T10:46:57-07:00","id":266301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=85542#post85542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Tell:</b> Compulsive nicknaming.<br /> <b>Emanation:</b> Converts nearby writing into <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elder_Futhark\" target=\"_blank\">futhark</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you satchel for mentioning Futhark! I think I have a Tell version of that emanation <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":654,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","user":"xiongrey","date":". 09-26-2014, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T14:14:27-07:00","id":267673,"title":"","content":"What about a Glitch that causes digital characters (video games, cartoons, CGI movies, est) to take on a life of their own and begin acting in a manner they weren't programmed or recorded to do? It could be called &quot;Playing God Machine&quot; or something like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Then your Demon convinces people to play Creepy Pasta games while they watch, and lets the good times role!<br /> <br /> <br /> Minor: The digital characters manifest free will and become aware that somebody is observing them, but they don't know who or where. They may start asking questions out into open space thinking the player is some kind of deity.<br /> <br /> <br /> Major: The digital characters not only manifest free will, but they appear to know personal details about the audience. They know who is watching them, and can interact with them accordingly, such as holding a conversation.<br /> <br /> <br /> Catastrophic: The digital characters manifest in the world as hard-light holograms, If they stray more than a certain distance from their screen, they dissipate, but otherwise they can physically interact with the mortal world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-28-2014, 05:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T12:37:13-07:00","id":933530,"title":"","content":"Stigmatic Brand: Blue Blood is really like the idea of blood blue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T10:44:16-07:00","id":934586,"title":"","content":"Catastrophic Glitches=<br /> <br /> Emanation- The reflections of people in the Demons' vicinity are instead the victims of said Demon rather than their own.<br /> <br /> Branding- The Demon's skin routinely crumbles and flakes away in patches like ashes, revealing glimpses of the demonic form beneath for a few seconds before reforming - only to do so again in different spots moments later.<br /> <br /> Tell- The Demon will speak the True Names of any person he meets for the first time.<br /> <br /> Major Glitches=<br /> <br /> Emanation- The Demon causes Book titles to change so that they give allusions to the secret occult world around people - while still being connected to the book's them to boot.<br /> <br /> Branding- The Demon's eyes glow brightly whenever an act of violence occurs in their presence.<br /> <br /> Tell- The Demon shouts in pain when words of religious devotion are said near them.<br /> <br /> Minor Glitches=<br /> <br /> Emanation- people/characters on TV will causally bring up the viewer's name in the Demon's vicinity.<br /> <br /> Branding- The Demon's fingernails change color/shade of color when a person turns away and looks back at them.<br /> <br /> Tell- The Demon quietly hisses if water touches them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 07-20-2016, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T10:47:04-07:00","id":934588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=267673#post267673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about a Glitch that causes digital characters (video games, cartoons, CGI movies, est) to take on a life of their own and begin acting in a manner they weren't programmed or recorded to do? It could be called &quot;Playing God Machine&quot; or something like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Then your Demon convinces people to play Creepy Pasta games while they watch, and lets the good times role!<br /> <br /> <br /> Minor: The digital characters manifest free will and become aware that somebody is observing them, but they don't know who or where. They may start asking questions out into open space thinking the player is some kind of deity.<br /> <br /> <br /> Major: The digital characters not only manifest free will, but they appear to know personal details about the audience. They know who is watching them, and can interact with them accordingly, such as holding a conversation.<br /> <br /> <br /> Catastrophic: The digital characters manifest in the world as hard-light holograms, If they stray more than a certain distance from their screen, they dissipate, but otherwise they can physically interact with the mortal world.</div> </div> </div> </div>These all would be emanations though, me thinks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T10:49:24-07:00","id":934590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=934586#post934586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Tell- The Demon will speak the True Names of any person he meets for the first time.<br /> <br /> Major Glitches=<br /> <br /> Branding- The Demon's eyes glow brightly whenever an act of violence occurs in their presence.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QESmhmR3DW8\" data-code=\"QESmhmR3DW8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/QESmhmR3DW8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T10:55:42-07:00","id":934595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=934590#post934590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QESmhmR3DW8\" data-code=\"QESmhmR3DW8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/QESmhmR3DW8/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>kind of like that, yeah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T12:42:58-07:00","id":934654,"title":"","content":"What can I say, I'm a lover of the classics...<br /> <br /> Binding Symbol- Tells<br /> <br /> The demon has acquired a personal symbol that influences his behavior. The behavior is commonly expressed in an inability to affect the symbol or interact with anything inside the pattern or in some cases anything directly touching it (including opening a door with the symbol carved upon it or physically touching a person wearing the symbol on their neck or as a tattoo). More unique behaviors experienced by individual demons are also possible. The symbol in question is usually made up of a series of geometric figures interlocked with one another in a pattern that is both beautiful and sinister to the eyes of mortals. The dimensions almost always have to be mathematically precise and may hold so occult significance in their numbers for the highly learned or insanely paranoid. Note that a demon can find itself trapped within such a pattern on occasion, usually by unwittingly entering an incomplete symbol and finding himself entrapped as the designer inscribes the final portion of the pattern. Escape usually necessitates making a pact that heavily favors the mortals or a clever or brutal use of embeds to indirectly destroy the pattern (a rain of blood usually does the trick...as does causing the ceiling to collapse. So long as the mathematical alignments are met, the pattern can be carved, drawn, or a physical item. Only in rare cases will this glitch have more specific requirements such as being drawn in blood or carved with tools made of some precious metal.<br /> <br /> Minor- The symbol is unique to that Demon, and unlikely to be known or discovered by outside parties unless powerful divinations are employed or the Demon himself lets the secret slip.<br /> <br /> Major- The symbol has manifested in several Demons over the centuries, and may appear in obscure texts. Often the Demons will have something in common with the character, making it possible to &quot;trace&quot; or otherwise deduce the Demon's vulnerability with enough knowledge of the Demon and painstaking research on the part of those willing to exploit the weakness.<br /> <br /> Catastrophic- The Demon's symbol, although needing to be mathematically precise in its proportions, is otherwise well known or common knowledge. Examples include religious symbols such as crosses, pentragrams, the Seal of Solomon, and so forth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T12:21:17-07:00","id":937212,"title":"","content":"<b>Tell: </b>Hats<br /> <br /> <b>Minor:</b> Must wear some type of hat during the night<br /> <b>Major:</b> Must wear a hat whenever outdoors.<br /> <b>Catastrophic:</b> Must wear a hat at all times. <br /> <br /> <b>Brand:</b> Teeth<br /> <br /> <b>Minor:</b> One of your teeth is an abnormal color, such as green or purple.<br /> <b>Major:</b> Most of your teeth resemble those of a certain animal.<br /> <b>Catastrophic:</b> You possess teeth that do not match those of any earthly animal, which come out whenever you open your mouth.<br /> <br /> <b>Emanation:</b> Rot<br /> <br /> <b>Minor:</b> Any house you sleep in starts smelling faintly of sulphur after a while. <br /> <b>Major:</b> All carcasses and food exposed to the air within your immediate presence attract a lot more flies than they should.<br /> <b>Catastrophic:</b> Your very presence causes meat to rot, milk to sour and metal to rust. This may cause sickness in others and the collapse of structures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T10:32:18-07:00","id":937670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/30545-enter-your-glitches-here?p=937212#post937212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Tell: </b>Hats<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Catastrophic:</b> Must wear a hat at all times.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh Jeebus, my Cover is so Glitched gais. halp me plz.<br /> <br /> Seriously though, I am this Glitch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}